{% raw %}
A ONE-TIME CODE WAS GENERATED FOR THE REQUESTED ACTION

Hello, {{ .DisplayName }}!

This notification was sent to verify your identity while changing security settings for your account at {{ .Domain }}.

Do not share this notification or its contents with anyone.

The one-time code below must only be used in the browser window displaying the corresponding request.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

{{ .OneTimeCode }}

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

If you did not initiate this process, your credentials may be compromised. You should:

 1. Revoke this code using the links below;
 2. Change your password or other login credentials;
 3. Contact your administrator.

{{ .RevocationLinkText }} {{ .RevocationLinkURL }}

To revoke the code, click the button above or copy and paste this URL into your browser address bar:

{{ .RevocationLinkURL }} {{ .RevocationLinkURL }}

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This notification is intended for {{ .DisplayName }}. This one-time code was generated by an action from IP address {{ .RemoteIP }}. If you are unsure whether your actions caused this event or are concerned about account security, follow the recommendations above.
{% endraw %}
